@startuml SD-04 Identify Node by Blink Command
title SD-04 Identify Node by Blink Command

actor Technician
participant "Node Registration Page" as Page
participant "Node Command API" as API
participant "MQTT Publisher" as Publisher
participant "MQTT Broker" as MQTT
participant "ESP32 Node" as Node

Technician -> Page: Click Identify / Blink
Page -> API: POST /nodes/{device_id}/blink
API -> Publisher: Publish blink command
Publisher -> MQTT: Command message
MQTT -> Node: Deliver command
Node -> Node: Blink LED
Node -> MQTT: Publish command ACK
MQTT -> API: ACK message received
API -> Page: Command accepted

@enduml